  "_note_ranges": "2026-09-15: range_ft for every combat-castable spell the regex draft left rangeless (it never carries a range, so effects.gd defaulted them all to 5 ft = touch). Areas carry shape + size_ft: up to a 5 m radius is one hex, bigger is a corner-anchored circle, a line runs from the caster through the aimed hex (adapter.gd _finish_verbs). Concentration spells hold their conditions until concentration ends; repeat_save says how the target shakes one off (end_turn default, on_damage, damage_ends, none).",
